{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an exhilarating journey through a world of dynamic ropes and creative problem-solving in RopeBot! Manipulate your way through challenging platforming levels using the innovative Rope Gun, a powerful tool that allows you to shoot and control ropes with unprecedented precision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of rope manipulation as you swing, climb, and solve intricate puzzles to progress through each level. Change the length of ropes, create connections between objects, and even pick up and transfer ropes using the Rope Belt, adding an extra layer of complexity to your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Rope Mechanics: Experience unparalleled control over ropes with the innovative Rope Gun, offering a unique and engaging gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Challenging Platforming: Navigate through meticulously crafted platforming levels, combining precision movement and rope manipulation to overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Intricate Puzzles: Put your problem-solving skills to the test as you encounter thought-provoking puzzles that require ingenious rope strategies to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Unleash Your Creativity: Embrace the freedom to devise your own solutions to challenges, encouraging outside-the-box thinking and rewarding creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Immersive Physics: Immerse yourself in a world where ropes behave realistically, offering a satisfying sense of momentum and interaction with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Endless Possibilities: Discover multiple ways to approach each level, allowing for endless experimentation and countless ways to reach your objectives.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2478560?t=1745414518","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478560/f1ec43161af1f4cbe2819ef52afc26b61c87af07/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745414518","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478560/72e364e4185ce486947600134e8b70f52ca09470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745414518","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478560/72e364e4185ce486947600134e8b70f52ca09470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745414518","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an exhilarating journey through a world of dynamic ropes and creative problem-solving in RopeBot! Manipulate your way through challenging platforming levels using the innovative Rope Gun, a powerful tool that allows you to shoot and control ropes with unprecedented precision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of rope manipulation as you swing, climb, and solve intricate puzzles to progress through each level. Change the length of ropes, create connections between objects, and even pick up and transfer ropes using the Rope Belt, adding an extra layer of complexity to your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Rope Mechanics: Experience unparalleled control over ropes with the innovative Rope Gun, offering a unique and engaging gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Challenging Platforming: Navigate through meticulously crafted platforming levels, combining precision movement and rope manipulation to overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Intricate Puzzles: Put your problem-solving skills to the test as you encounter thought-provoking puzzles that require ingenious rope strategies to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Unleash Your Creativity: Embrace the freedom to devise your own solutions to challenges, encouraging outside-the-box thinking and rewarding creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Immersive Physics: Immerse yourself in a world where ropes behave realistically, offering a satisfying sense of momentum and interaction with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Endless Possibilities: Discover multiple ways to approach each level, allowing for endless experimentation and countless ways to reach your objectives.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Scott Ewing"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478560/58fb60e9f8d1f70b3dc5b0c77fc64d6b92c3ec4c/header.jpg?t=1745414518","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120001,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120001/movie480.mp4?t=1743530777","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120001/movie_max.mp4?t=1743530777"},"name":"Rope Robot - Gameplay Trailer 3","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120001/fdda3f05b961a048cef04eb2acba64a0af303e13/movie_600x337.jpg